{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02991","headline":"感遇十二首 三 · 张九龄","name":"感遇十二首 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"鱼游乐深池，鸟栖欲高枝。\n嗟尔蜉蝣羽，薨薨亦何爲。\n有生岂不化，所感奚若斯。\n神理日微灭，吾心安得知。\n浩叹杨朱子，徒然泣路岐。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张九龄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02991.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02991","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}